# Cursor summary contract

When completing an implementation spec or task, your final response **must** include **both**:

1. **Technical summary** — What changed in code (files, behavior). Enough for a developer to review the diff.
2. **Plain-language summary** — One to three sentences on **user-visible impact** (what users/operators will notice).

A spec is **not** complete until both sections are present. See `docs/CURSOR_SUMMARY_CONTRACT.md` for the full contract.
